{"2870940": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Throne Tides", "steam_appid": 2870940, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >BUILD YOUR DECK. SET YOUR FORMATION. DEFEND YOUR KING.</h2><br>Throne Tides is a deck-building tower defense auto battler. Bring creatures, spells and abilities into each match, place your army during the Build phase, then watch the battle unfold across contested lanes.<br><br>Your units act on their own once combat starts, so every choice before the clash matters. Read the opposing formation, reinforce a weak lane, find better matchups and decide where your resources will make the biggest difference.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2870940/extras/839a5dd34079bdc2d80cf2d24de32c47.poster.avif?t=1788280734\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2870940/extras/839a5dd34079bdc2d80cf2d24de32c47.webm?t=1788280734\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2870940/extras/839a5dd34079bdc2d80cf2d24de32c47.mp4?t=1788280734\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >BUILD A DECK THAT CAN ADAPT</h2><br>Creatures come from distinct fantasy factions, supported by spells and special abilities. Build around synergies, but keep enough flexibility to answer the opposing army.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2870940/extras/2f0ae5cda2f4601074d067f76141b4a2.poster.avif?t=1788280734\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2870940/extras/2f0ae5cda2f4601074d067f76141b4a2.webm?t=1788280734\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2870940/extras/2f0ae5cda2f4601074d067f76141b4a2.mp4?t=1788280734\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >PLACE, MERGE AND REPOSITION</h2><br>Where a creature stands matters. Protect key units, change a bad matchup, and merge two copies of the same creature into a stronger battlefield unit. Once the round begins, your formation has to hold.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2870940/extras/1e5f225ff2c3cf101825694bc93b0297.poster.avif?t=1788280734\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2870940/extras/1e5f225ff2c3cf101825694bc93b0297.webm?t=1788280734\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2870940/extras/1e5f225ff2c3cf101825694bc93b0297.mp4?t=1788280734\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CONTROL THE MAP. FUND THE NEXT FIGHT.</h2><br>Controlling magical fountains and other map objectives increases your income and funds the next reinforcement. You can also invest in your King's Health, Damage and Income, choosing between surviving the next attack and investing for the late game.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2870940/extras/318b0f580674a7908353e4f62ed6fbb5.poster.avif?t=1788280734\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2870940/extras/318b0f580674a7908353e4f62ed6fbb5.webm?t=1788280734\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2870940/extras/318b0f580674a7908353e4f62ed6fbb5.mp4?t=1788280734\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ADAPT WITH AUGMENTS</h2><br>Choose augments as the battle develops. Strengthen what is already working or cover a weakness before the next fight.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >PLAY ONLINE OR TAKE ON THE CAMPAIGN</h2><br>Challenge other players in online PvP, team up in online co-op, or take your deck through the single-player campaign.<br><br>If you enjoy building decks, solving formations and watching a plan pay off, add Throne Tides to your wishlist.", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >BUILD YOUR DECK. SET YOUR FORMATION. DEFEND YOUR KING.</h2><br>Throne Tides is a deck-building tower defense auto battler. Bring creatures, spells and abilities into each match, place your army during the Build phase, then watch the battle unfold across contested lanes.<br><br>Your units act on their own once combat starts, so every choice before the clash matters. Read the opposing formation, reinforce a weak lane, find better matchups and decide where your resources will make the biggest difference.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2870940/extras/839a5dd34079bdc2d80cf2d24de32c47.poster.avif?t=1788280734\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2870940/extras/839a5dd34079bdc2d80cf2d24de32c47.webm?t=1788280734\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2870940/extras/839a5dd34079bdc2d80cf2d24de32c47.mp4?t=1788280734\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >BUILD A DECK THAT CAN ADAPT</h2><br>Creatures come from distinct fantasy factions, supported by spells and special abilities. Build around synergies, but keep enough flexibility to answer the opposing army.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2870940/extras/2f0ae5cda2f4601074d067f76141b4a2.poster.avif?t=1788280734\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2870940/extras/2f0ae5cda2f4601074d067f76141b4a2.webm?t=1788280734\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2870940/extras/2f0ae5cda2f4601074d067f76141b4a2.mp4?t=1788280734\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >PLACE, MERGE AND REPOSITION</h2><br>Where a creature stands matters. Protect key units, change a bad matchup, and merge two copies of the same creature into a stronger battlefield unit. Once the round begins, your formation has to hold.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2870940/extras/1e5f225ff2c3cf101825694bc93b0297.poster.avif?t=1788280734\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2870940/extras/1e5f225ff2c3cf101825694bc93b0297.webm?t=1788280734\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2870940/extras/1e5f225ff2c3cf101825694bc93b0297.mp4?t=1788280734\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CONTROL THE MAP. FUND THE NEXT FIGHT.</h2><br>Controlling magical fountains and other map objectives increases your income and funds the next reinforcement. You can also invest in your King's Health, Damage and Income, choosing between surviving the next attack and investing for the late game.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2870940/extras/318b0f580674a7908353e4f62ed6fbb5.poster.avif?t=1788280734\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2870940/extras/318b0f580674a7908353e4f62ed6fbb5.webm?t=1788280734\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2870940/extras/318b0f580674a7908353e4f62ed6fbb5.mp4?t=1788280734\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ADAPT WITH AUGMENTS</h2><br>Choose augments as the battle develops. Strengthen what is already working or cover a weakness before the next fight.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >PLAY ONLINE OR TAKE ON THE CAMPAIGN</h2><br>Challenge other players in online PvP, team up in online co-op, or take your deck through the single-player campaign.<br><br>If you enjoy building decks, solving formations and watching a plan pay off, add Throne Tides to your wishlist.", "short_description": "Build a deck, place and merge your creatures, and defend your King in a tower defense auto battler. Battle across contested lanes in online PvP, team up in online co-op, or take your deck through a single-player campaign.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French, German, Spanish - Spain, Bulgarian, Greek, Swedish, Traditional Chinese, Turkish, Simplified Chinese<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2870940/header.jpg?t=1788280734", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2870940/7afccc067d86a8eda9220c9b2ea115231f75fc04/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1788280734", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2870940/7afccc067d86a8eda9220c9b2ea115231f75fc04/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1788280734", "website": "https://thronetides.com", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong>  Windows 7 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong>  Dual core from Intel or AMD at 2.8GHz+<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</stro